# package-lock.json IS committed: it pins the exact library versions the release
# was built with, so a reviewer's `npm install` reproduces the same bundle.

# Build output. main.js and pdf.worker.js are generated by `npm run build`, but
# they are ALSO what Obsidian loads, so they are committed on release branches
# and attached to the GitHub release. Uncomment if you build on CI instead.
